743	/// a [`Kind::Literal`] spec matches the bare `--`, a [`Kind::Bool`] spec its name after `no-`,
744	/// a spec whose kind [`is_option`](Kind::is_option) its name, and a [`Kind::Value`] spec its
745	/// name before the first `=` of `arg`. Names compare as bytes, as `strcmp` compares them.
746	///
