3071	        /// returns other than 0, as `cli_opt_foreach` calls the function it is given.
3072	        ///
3073	        /// # Safety
3074	        ///
3075	        /// `f` may be called with `ctx` as its second argument, any number of times, on the
3076	        /// calling thread, until `'f` ends; each call passes it an outcome that lends what it
